        {
          "text": "Amulange, bulumbu bwabasimilimo bakamutebwida mumyuunda yanu, mbumwabanyanzya calweeno, buloongolola, eno kulila kwabatebuzi kwanjila mumatwi aa-Mwami wamakamu makamu. ",
