        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwesu, amukazike myoyo mane kusikila kukuboola kwa-Mwami. Amubone, mukamwini muunda ulalindilila micelo miyandisi yaansi, waikazikila moyo mane ikawigwe imvula yakuntangilo ayabili. ",
