        {
          "text": "Tulaamba kuti, Mbasicoolwe bakakatila, Mulimvwide kale aalukakatilo lwa-Jobo, alimwi mulizi mbwaakamucitila­ Jehova kumamanino. Mwabona kuti Jehova ngusibuuya, ngusiluzyalo,",
