                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija wakali muntu uulya maila mbubonya mbuli ndiswe. Wakakomba kuti imvula itawi, nkabela ncobeni teeyakawa ansi myaaka yotatwe amyeezi iili musanu muumwi. ",
          "type": "text",
